(7730018, 1272840, 114285, '<td valign="top">Love the scene. Israel I assume? So wonderful everything about it, even down to how the girl on the right is carrying her bag - little women indeed. Beautifully processed, sharp and vivid.<br/> <br/>Bumping up, my pick for a ribbon.</td>', 'Love the scene. Israel I assume? So wonderful everything about it, even down to how the girl on the right is carrying her bag - little women indeed. Beautifully processed, sharp and vivid. Bumping up, my pick for a ribbon.', '2022-09-21 01:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
