(7730168, 1272929, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific image.  The people are facing away, naturally enough. Then your processing begins its journey into the light, which beautifully holds the water, even to the next wave out, barely hinted at.  It feels sculpted out of spun sugar and froth, fragile and strong concurrently.  A tour de force.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Terrific image.  The people are facing away, naturally enough. Then your processing begins its journey into the light, which beautifully holds the water, even to the next wave out, barely hinted at.  It feels sculpted out of spun sugar and froth, fragile and strong concurrently.  A tour de force.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-09-23 00:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730169, 1273052, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shown, whites in order, tinged with gold against sumptuous blues.  Can''t imagine this bird looking any more perfect.  Could be a flag for the Audubon Society.<br/>Personal second co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully shown, whites in order, tinged with gold against sumptuous blues.  Can''t imagine this bird looking any more perfect.  Could be a flag for the Audubon Society.Personal second co-favorite of the challenge.', '2022-09-23 00:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730170, 1272954, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Seems out of a fairy tale, within which magic is a commonplace.  The focus on the near middle ground enhances this feeling.  Beautiful sea and sky.<br/>I do, however, have a quibble.  The little girl''s red outfit is, for me, kind of jarring and pat, not really natural.  A point higher if it had been otherwise.<br/>Personal second co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely.  Seems out of a fairy tale, within which magic is a commonplace.  The focus on the near middle ground enhances this feeling.  Beautiful sea and sky.I do, however, have a quibble.  The little girl''s red outfit is, for me, kind of jarring and pat, not really natural.  A point higher if it had been otherwise.Personal second co-favorite of the challenge.', '2022-09-23 00:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730174, 1272989, 114285, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your second red, next one will be a blue hopefully.</td>', 'Congratulations on your second red, next one will be a blue hopefully.', '2022-09-23 01:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730175, 1272840, 114285, '<td valign="top">Im quite surprised with your score, I picked you as a ribbon winner for sure. Such a charming little image.<br/>I thought it was either you or Kobi.</td>', 'Im quite surprised with your score, I picked you as a ribbon winner for sure. Such a charming little image.I thought it was either you or Kobi.', '2022-09-23 01:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
