(7730180, 1272804, 68504, '<td valign="top">picture of vulnerability. that wisp of hair, not quite a comb over, the untrendy short sleeves. and yet: there is a companion, and possibly there will be champagne in the bucket.  we don''t know. just a man, almost alone in by a window with just the suspicion of a view of sea and sky. iteration of squares/diamonds in the shirt, the floor the cushioned seat back - possibly that is what you saw. he belongs.</td>', 'picture of vulnerability. that wisp of hair, not quite a comb over, the untrendy short sleeves. and yet: there is a companion, and possibly there will be champagne in the bucket.  we don''t know. just a man, almost alone in by a window with just the suspicion of a view of sea and sky. iteration of squares/diamonds in the shirt, the floor the cushioned seat back - possibly that is what you saw. he belongs.', '2022-09-23 03:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730182, 1272954, 67145, '<td valign="top">especially precious .. <br/>i''m absolutely loving your edit with the mirroring of the red dress colour in the sky .. makes me feel she''s like a little spirit looking up into ''heaven'' .. <br/>the raised arm .. gives another element .. almost like the beginnings of a wave of recognition .. <br/>so .. lol .. how wonderful photographs are ... we can imbue them with whatever our hearts desire .. <br/>well some photographs that is .. and this is one of them . <br/>beautiful Anita .. you are one of my favourite photographers .. <br/>of course i have a few .. i get around .. haha .. xx</td>', 'especially precious .. i''m absolutely loving your edit with the mirroring of the red dress colour in the sky .. makes me feel she''s like a little spirit looking up into ''heaven'' .. the raised arm .. gives another element .. almost like the beginnings of a wave of recognition .. so .. lol .. how wonderful photographs are ... we can imbue them with whatever our hearts desire .. well some photographs that is .. and this is one of them . beautiful Anita .. you are one of my favourite photographers .. of course i have a few .. i get around .. haha .. xx', '2022-09-23 03:51:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730183, 1272954, 67145, '<td valign="top">i find it interesting that some commenters see the ''unnaturalness'' of some images .. not having a go at you at all Rich .. because i know exactly what you mean .. <br/> <br/>so unless we take a totally candid shot there is often a degree of ''setting up'' .. placing things as we want them .. posing ppl .. putting them in particular clothing ..  etc etc .. <br/> <br/>and if we did some or all of the above the challenge is to create natural out of unnatural .. <br/> <br/>i find that challenging myself ... fortunately its rarely i get to dress, pose or set up shots in my life .. but if i did i reckon i''d fail miserably at making the resulting image look authentic and natural .. <br/> <br/>your photo Anita .. altho the little girl is dressed obviously for the occasion .. seems to have bypassed the inauthentic look and takes me back to a time gone by .. another example of your brilliance .. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'i find it interesting that some commenters see the ''unnaturalness'' of some images .. not having a go at you at all Rich .. because i know exactly what you mean ..  so unless we take a totally candid shot there is often a degree of ''setting up'' .. placing things as we want them .. posing ppl .. putting them in particular clothing ..  etc etc ..  and if we did some or all of the above the challenge is to create natural out of unnatural ..  i find that challenging myself ... fortunately its rarely i get to dress, pose or set up shots in my life .. but if i did i reckon i''d fail miserably at making the resulting image look authentic and natural ..  your photo Anita .. altho the little girl is dressed obviously for the occasion .. seems to have bypassed the inauthentic look and takes me back to a time gone by .. another example of your brilliance .. :) ', '2022-09-23 03:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730184, 1273052, 67145, '<td valign="top">i loved this in voting .. and it made me laugh .. always a good thing .. <br/>i see i gave you a 7 .. i dont know what came over me .. as looking at it now .. combined with your witty title .. i should have hit the 8 or 9 .. <br/>apologies .. :)</td>', 'i loved this in voting .. and it made me laugh .. always a good thing .. i see i gave you a 7 .. i dont know what came over me .. as looking at it now .. combined with your witty title .. i should have hit the 8 or 9 .. apologies .. :)', '2022-09-23 04:01:06.000000', NULL, 0),
