(7730191, 1272954, 66597, '<td valign="top">Anita, this is simply beautiful. Although I understand Richs point about the red dress and it may not be to everyones taste, to me it adds to the richness and depth in this image. I think it is nicely rounded out by the subtle red flowers in the foreground.</td>', 'Anita, this is simply beautiful. Although I understand Richs point about the red dress and it may not be to everyones taste, to me it adds to the richness and depth in this image. I think it is nicely rounded out by the subtle red flowers in the foreground.', '2022-09-23 08:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730192, 1272954, 101668, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous of course</td>', 'Gorgeous of course', '2022-09-23 09:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730198, 1272989, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely and emotive - a sweet story told well here. Congratulations on your ribbon!<br/>ETA - I just saw this is your PB. Mega congratulations!! <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2022-09-23 10:55:47.</i></td>', 'Lovely and emotive - a sweet story told well here. Congratulations on your ribbon!ETA - I just saw this is your PB. Mega congratulations!! ', '2022-09-23 11:54:31.000000', '2022-09-23 11:55:47.000000', 0),
(7730199, 1272954, 173844, '<td valign="top">And I understand your points, too, Anita, Roz and Catherine.  Sometimes my preferences get tangled with rigidity.</td>', 'And I understand your points, too, Anita, Roz and Catherine.  Sometimes my preferences get tangled with rigidity.', '2022-09-23 12:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7730207, 1272840, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love this one. <br/>I kept looking at it and my eye kept getting drawn into the background rather than being focused on the main subjects. I played with it a bit and figured I should share.  <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1273297" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1273297.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1273297.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1273297.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a> <br/>It''s a little rough but hey sometimes I miss those editing side-challenges I used to participate in ;)<br/>Beautiful shot in a really cool place.</td>', 'I love this one. I kept looking at it and my eye kept getting drawn into the background rather than being focused on the main subjects. I played with it a bit and figured I should share.   It''s a little rough but hey sometimes I miss those editing side-challenges I used to participate in ;)Beautiful shot in a really cool place.', '2022-09-23 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
